WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.623
Visualization should respect the variable structure
Bar charts

00:00:05.637 --> 00:00:11.758
work well for nominal categories Ordered bars
preserve the order of ordinal categories

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:19.047
Histograms show the distribution of continuous
numeric variables Scatterplots

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:24.606
show relationships between two numeric variables A
chart should make the

00:00:24.619 --> 00:00:31.014
intended comparison easier without adding structure
that the data does not contain For

00:00:31.027 --> 00:00:36.146
example connecting unordered categories with a line
can accidentally imply continuity
